@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:security] marshall-probes-fixture-authority
Probe-only authorization bypasses and magic-link token creation MUST NOT be
exposed through production HTTP actions. Operators MUST direct smoke/probe
scripts only at the disposable test database.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:verification] marshall-probes-observed-outcomes
Browser/guest probes MUST distinguish terminal echo from executed guest output,
VMM running state from guest shell readiness, and delivered commands from observed
physical outcomes. Success claims MUST reflect these observations.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:security] marshall-probes-sensitive-output
Probe login links, credentials and guest terminal bytes MUST stay out of printed
diagnostics. Temporary context files containing tokens MUST be private and
removed by the owning fixture's cleanup.
